- op: discuss  # 6e97
  at: '2026-03-06T05:33:22Z'  # 6e97
  by: agent  # 6e97
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6e97
  clock: 8  # 6e97
  nonce: '6e97'  # 6e97
  message: "Fixed in PR #1789. Root cause: tracker auto-sync created its branch from HEAD (feature branch), causing the sync PR to include feature branch code. Fix uses git plumbing (read-tree/write-tree/commit-tree) with a temporary index to build the commit on top of origin/dev without checkout."  # 6e97
